## 07_trees - 

This directory contains the pipeline for generating phylogenetic trees for Class I and Class II Fumarase sequences using both Amino Acid (AA) and Structural (3Di) data.

## Data

- 'results/alignments/class1_aa_clustered_aligned.fasta'
- 'results/alignments/class2_aa_clustered_aligned.fasta'

- 'data/processed/class1_3di_clustered_aligned.fasta'
- 'data/processed/class2_3di_clustered_aligned.fasta'


## Tree Generation



Trees where generated via the IQTree CLI.
The regular amino acid based trees were made using the Q.pfam model, after it was found best fitting during earlier generation rounds,
with the following commands:

1. Full trees (AA):

iqtree -s results/alignments/class1_aa_clustered_aligned.fasta \
    --prefix results/trees/class1/AA_clustered_2k \
    -mem 128G -nt AUTO -ntmax 12 -bb 1000 -nm 2000 -m Q.pfam
    
iqtree -s results/alignments/class2_aa_clustered_aligned_80.fasta \
    --prefix results/trees/class2/AA_clustered2k_qpfam_r8 \
    -mem 128G -ntmax 12 -nt AUTO -m Q.pfam+R8 -bb 1000 -m Q.pfam+R8

2. Full trees (3Di):

iqtree -s results/alignments/class1_3di_clustered_aligned.fasta \
    --prefix results/trees/class1/3di_clustered \
    -bb 1000 -st AA -mem 128G \
    -m data/external/Q.3Di.LLM.m+G4 \
    -nt AUTO -ntmax 10 -nm 2000

iqtree -s results/alignments/class2_3di_clustered_aligned.fasta \
    --prefix results/trees/class2/3di_clustered \
    -bb 1000 -st AA -mem 128G \
    -m data/external/Q.3Di.LLM.m+G4 \
    -nt AUTO -ntmax 10 -nm 2000

3. Sample trees:

iqtree -s results/alignments/subset_alignments/class2_aligned_subtree4.fasta \
     --prefix results/trees/class2/subtrees/class2_subtree4 \
     -mem 64G -ntmax 6 -nt AUTO -mset Q.pfam -bb 1000 -alrt 1000


## Run - plot trees

Unrooted Trees:

Rscript scripts/08_plots/tree_plot_unrooted.R \
		data/processed/proteome_metadata.tsv \
		results/trees/class1/AA_clustered_2k.treefile \
		results/figures/unrooted/unrooted_tree_class1_AA_2k_final.png
    
Circular Trees:

Rscript scripts/08_plots/tree_plot_circular.R \
		data/processed/proteome_metadata.tsv \
    results/trees/class1/AA_clustered_2k.treefile \
		results/figures/circular/circular_tree_class1_AA_clustered_2k_final.png

